                                "sense_id": "971b6ab5-2915-3840-becd-9b91b36df28a",
                                "text": "How could these publishers foresense (what anyone can now perceive) that to give Dr. Sidis their clients' humorous writings to quote from would be like giving a Gutenburg Bible to the baby?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c728d5b-8d88-4972-ae31-3ca4f98550a3",
                                "sense_id": "971b6ab5-2915-3840-becd-9b91b36df28a",
                                "text": "He knows much, but he foresenses more than he chooses to tell.\""
