                                "example_id": "40a98331-1a87-4b36-8818-db32035aa118",
                                "sense_id": "971b6ab5-2915-3840-becd-9b91b36df28a",
                                "text": "“Hey—” The way animals—men and dogs—foresense a great act of weather is in a sudden confusion of terms, an eerie loss of measurement."
